    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "夜に咲く花なので、月を見る草という名前です。",
      "english_translation": "Because it blooms at night, its name is \"Moon-seeing flower.\""
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "このとき、白色の花が咲きます。",
      "english_translation": "At this time, white flowers will bloom."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "そして、次の日の朝、花が閉じます。",
      "english_translation": "And the next morning, the flowers would close up."
    },
